# A fight, round by round.
#
# This is the scenario the harness was said not to be able to have: "the two
# servers do not consume the RNG sequence in the same order, so a script that
# fights something is comparing rolls rather than wording"
# (docs/developer.md, before this suite). With the seed fixed on both sides
# *and* the mobiles held still (-M, --freeze-mobiles) they do consume it in
# the same order, which is why the abilities `score` prints agree and why the
# rounds below can be compared at all.
Parityone
y
swordfish
swordfish
m
w

1
goto 3001
load mob 3062
look
consider fido
kill fido
look
# What is left of it, and what the room says about that.
look in corpse
# Refusals.
kill nobody
kill self
flee
hit
quit
